{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13453","headline":"浔阳陶氏别业 · 刘眘虚","name":"浔阳陶氏别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陶家习先隐，种柳长江边。\n朝夕浔阳郭，白衣来几年。\n霁云明孤岭，秋水澄寒天。\n物象自清旷，野情何绵联。\n萧萧丘中赏，明宰非徒然。\n愿守黍稷税，归耕东山田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘眘虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}